  "contract": "M6 target 80-slice coefficient stats and reduce only. Both kernels trigger at entry after their wait. Arithmetic unchanged. Each kernel waits at entry before dependent global reads. All CTAs execute the trigger. Requires programmatic stream serialization launch attribute; no assumption of concurrent residency. Normal CUDA events preserve auxiliary joins.",
